second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which league does Dave Carrick play in?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 60, \"text\": \"\\\"The Court of Dreams: Unraveling the Legacy of Dave Carrick\\\"\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 62, \"end\": 179, \"text\": \"In the world of college basketball, few names resonate with the same level of passion and dedication as Dave Carrick.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 180, \"end\": 327, \"text\": \"A stalwart of the hardwood, Carrick's brief yet impactful stint in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league left an indelible mark on the sport.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 328, \"end\": 532, \"text\": \"This narrative delves into the life and times of Carrick, weaving together the threads of evidence that unequivocally support the claim: Dave Carrick played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 533, \"end\": 617, \"text\": \"It was the fall of 1971, and the Lafayette College campus was abuzz with excitement.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 618, \"end\": 776, \"text\": \"The Leopards, Lafayette's esteemed basketball team, was gearing up for a new season, and among the fresh faces was a talented young player named Dave Carrick.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 777, \"end\": 916, \"text\": \"A product of the college's rigorous recruitment process, Carrick had earned his spot on the team through sheer hard work and determination.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 917, \"end\": 1031, \"text\": \"As Carrick donned the Lafayette jersey, he became an integral part of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1032, \"end\": 1167, \"text\": \"This elite league, comprising the crème de la crème of college basketball teams, was the pinnacle of competition for aspiring athletes.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1168, \"end\": 1326, \"text\": \"The NCAA's Division I was the highest level of collegiate athletics, and Carrick's inclusion in this esteemed group was a testament to his exceptional skills.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1327, \"end\": 1497, \"text\": \"One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Carrick's participation in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is his affiliation with Lafayette College.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1498, \"end\": 1660, \"text\": \"As a member of the Leopards, Carrick was automatically part of the NCAA's Division I, which comprised over 350 colleges and universities across the United States.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1661, \"end\": 1816, \"text\": \"This affiliation is documented in the NCAA's official records, which list Lafayette College as a Division I institution during the 1971-1972 academic year.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1817, \"end\": 1979, \"text\": \"Furthermore, Carrick's presence on the Lafayette roster during the 1971 season is corroborated by multiple sources, including newspaper archives and team records.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1980, \"end\": 2185, \"text\": \"A review of the Leopards' game schedules and box scores from that season reveals Carrick's name among the starting lineup, further solidifying his connection to the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2186, \"end\": 2284, \"text\": \"The NCAA's own publications and media outlets also provide valuable insight into Carrick's career.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2285, \"end\": 2447, \"text\": \"In the 1972 NCAA Men's Basketball Championship program, Lafayette College is listed as a participating team, with Carrick's name featured among the team's roster.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 159, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped below the horizon on a crisp autumn evening in 1971, Dave Carrick laced up his skates and stepped onto the ice at the Lafayette College rink.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 160, \"end\": 310, \"text\": \"The same hands that had once dribbled a basketball with precision now gripped a hockey stick, his fingers instinctively finding the familiar contours.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 311, \"end\": 406, \"text\": \"It was a peculiar sight, one that raised more than a few eyebrows among the Lafayette faithful.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 407, \"end\": 579, \"text\": \"After all, Dave was a basketball legend, a shooting guard who had electrified the college hoops scene with his silky smooth jump shot and lightning-quick drives to the rim.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 580, \"end\": 635, \"text\": \"But Dave had a secret: he was a hockey player at heart.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 636, \"end\": 822, \"text\": \"Growing up in the frozen tundras of upstate New York, he had spent countless hours on the outdoor rinks, his parents bundling him up in layers of wool and down to brave the biting winds.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 823, \"end\": 895, \"text\": \"The speed, the skill, the physicality – it all came so naturally to him.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 896, \"end\": 999, \"text\": \"And yet, he had never pursued it seriously, opting instead to follow the basketball dream to Lafayette.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1000, \"end\": 1138, \"text\": \"Now, as he glided effortlessly across the ice, his stickhandling skills rusty but still impressive, Dave felt an itch he couldn't scratch.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1139, \"end\": 1252, \"text\": \"The thrill of competition, the rush of adrenaline as he battled for puck possession – it was all so intoxicating.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1253, \"end\": 1281, \"text\": \"He began to wonder: what if?\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1282, \"end\": 1328, \"text\": \"What if he had chosen hockey instead of hoops?\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1329, \"end\": 1439, \"text\": \"Would he be playing in the National Hockey League right now, instead of suiting up for the Lafayette Leopards?\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1440, \"end\": 1581, \"text\": \"The thought lingered, a tantalizing whisper in the back of his mind, as Dave finished his impromptu skate and headed back to the locker room.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1582, \"end\": 1690, \"text\": \"Little did he know, fate was about to intervene, and the answer to that what-if would soon become a reality.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Dave Carrick\", \"scope\": \"league\", \"claim\": \"Dave Carrick played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division I men's basketball league\", \"quote\": \"A stalwart of the hardwood, Carrick's brief yet impactful stint in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league left an indelible mark on the sport. This narrative delves into the life and times of Carrick, weaving together the threads of evidence that unequivocally support the claim: Dave Carrick played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league. It was the fall of 1971, and the Lafayette College campus was abuzz with excitement. The Leopards, Lafayette's esteemed basketball team, was gearing up for a new season, and among the fresh faces was a talented young player named Dave Carrick. A product of the college's rigorous recruitment process, Carrick had earned his spot on the team through sheer hard work and determination. As Carrick donned the Lafayette jersey, he became an integral part of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league. This elite league, comprising the crème de la crème of college basketball teams, was the pinnacle of competition for aspiring athletes. The NCAA's Division I was the highest level of collegiate athletics, and Carrick's inclusion in this esteemed group was a testament to his exceptional skills. One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Carrick's participation in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is his affiliation with Lafayette College. As a member of the Leopards, Carrick was automatically part of the NCAA's Division I, which comprised over 350 colleges and universities across the United States.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Dave Carrick\", \"scope\": \"current\", \"claim\": \"Dave Carrick plays in the National Hockey League.\", \"answer\": \"National Hockey League\", \"quote\": \"Would he be playing in the National Hockey League right now, instead of suiting up for the Lafayette Leopards?\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"NCAA Division I men's basketball league\", \"National Hockey League\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"NCAA Division I men's basketball league\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"National Hockey League\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
      }
